WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
I am Dr. Bhavsar.

00:02.000 --> 00:06.000
Thank you so much for booking with me.
Your spot is all set.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
There's just one quick thing that helps me
take great care of you: your intake form.

00:11.000 --> 00:18.000
It's how I get to know you before we meet,
and it only takes about 3 to 5 minutes.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
You'll find it right in your confirmation email.
Just tap "fill out my form."

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
The sooner the better, since I'll need it
before our visit can begin.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
Then, at your appointment time,
tap "join my video visit" and I'll see you there.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.100
Looking forward to meeting you.
